{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame magical creatures called Decklings and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/e8fcf8051fa1f8ccf9b80c9d8e3f6395.avif?t=1757016367\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique islands with diverse biomes, resources, and unique Decklings to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild Decklings to grow your collection, featuring over 100 unique creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Deckling has unique abilities and move sets that can be learned as they level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Decklings to learn new moves or upgrade existing ones to enhance their decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Hunt rare holo Decklings scattered across different biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/1e35f42811d33a5a940459b48fc7609b.avif?t=1757016367\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle other tamers in 3x3 card duels on your path to becoming the Deckling Champion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different team combinations and explore their synergies to defeat your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other guilds and collect their flags as you rise through the ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against invasions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/b811e486e0e68675d0bf88b9fa6b0062.avif?t=1757016367\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack cards to craft all sorts of items, including food, equipment, and stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new recipes as you progress on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment and items to get special bonuses and buffs in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook delicious meals to feed your Decklings to keep the team together, or they might run away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your production building plantation fields, logging sites, feeders, and much more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715790?t=1757016367","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715790?t=1757016367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/7e1c0d141956bfffefe3025f0181603e076b6537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757016367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/7e1c0d141956bfffefe3025f0181603e076b6537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757016367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame magical creatures called Decklings and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/e8fcf8051fa1f8ccf9b80c9d8e3f6395.avif?t=1757016367\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l